  <main>
    <section class="hero"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744095-fcf48d80b0fd?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A quiet conference room where clients meet with their attorney" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present">Present</span><span class="tw future on">Future</span></div>
        <h1>Wills, trusts and estate planning, <em>done properly.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Tercet Law is an estate planning and elder law firm. Wills, trusts, powers of attorney, probate and business succession, with flat fees quoted up front and an attorney who explains every page. Confidential, virtual, on your schedule.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">A confidential 30-minute planning call. No charge.</p>
      </div></div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>Flat</b><span>Fees, quoted up front</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Attorney, start to finish</span></div><div><b>Virtual</b><span>Appointments, on your schedule</span></div><div><b>AL</b><span>Licensed · Texas admission pending</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="split" id="problem"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop');background-position:center" role="img" aria-label="Reviewing estate documents at a desk"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why now</p><h2>An estate without a plan is settled by a court.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>Without a will, state law decides who inherits and who is in charge.</li><li>A trust that was never funded protects nothing.</li><li>A health directive and powers of attorney keep decisions with the people you chose.</li></ul>
    </div></section>

    <section class="split rev alt" id="approach"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450101499163-c8848c66ca85?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop');background-position:center" role="img" aria-label="Signing a document with a fountain pen"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h2>One attorney. One flat fee. Every page explained.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>We begin with what you own, who you are responsible for, and what you intend.</li><li>Will, revocable trust, health directive and powers of attorney, drafted to fit.</li><li>We fund the trust with you, so it holds what it is meant to hold.</li><li>Signed, witnessed, and kept current as life changes.</li></ul>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/process">See the process</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="/services">Practice areas</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Practice focus</p><h2>What do you need?</h2></div>
      <div class="pcards"><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791055366-0d553872125f?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Signing an estate plan" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Plan</span><b>Estate planning</b><em>A will, directives and powers of attorney, drafted and signed properly.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570129477492-45c003edd2be?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A family home with a wide front porch" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Protect</span><b>Trusts</b><em>A revocable trust, funded, to keep your estate private and out of probate.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573497019940-1c28c88b4f3e?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="An attorney listening to a client" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">Settle</span><b>Probate and elder law</b><em>Settling an estate, or planning for a parent, with steady guidance.</em></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec" id="what"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Practice areas</p><h2>Five areas. One firm.</h2></div><div class="gallery five"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1664575602276-acd073f104c1?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Planning documents on a desk" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Wills and directives</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505664194779-8beaceb93744?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A law library" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Trusts</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-6726b3ff858f?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Estate paperwork on a desk" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Probate</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631217875019-8cb2649c3478?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="An attorney meeting with an older couple" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Elder law</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791136064-7986c2920216?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A handshake across a desk" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Business succession</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your attorney</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">An attorney since 2014, practicing from Austin. Twenty years leading organizations alongside the practice, and he brings that steadiness to the table: clear answers, careful documents, no pressure.</p><blockquote>A good plan is not about the end. It is about the people you love knowing exactly what you intended.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">Start with a confidential planning call.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>The call</h3><p>A confidential thirty minutes. What you have, what you want, what it costs.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>The plan</h3><p>One flat fee. Will, trust, directive, powers of attorney. Drafted, explained, signed.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The keeping</h3><p>We fund the trust, deliver your documents, and review the plan when life changes.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="after"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What changes</p><h2>When it is done.</h2></div>
      <div class="after"><div><b>Your wishes are in writing.</b><p>Who decides, who inherits, and where everything is.</p></div><div><b>Your estate stays private.</b><p>A funded trust keeps it out of the courthouse.</p></div><div><b>Your family has a guide.</b><p>One attorney who already knows the plan.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>Simple to start.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Essentials</h3><div class="price ">From $1,500</div><p>Will, health directive, powers of attorney. Signed and explained.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/pricing">See fees</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Most chosen</div><h3>The Trust Plan</h3><div class="price price-word">Quoted</div><p>Revocable trust, funded. Everything in the Essentials.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing">See fees</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">For business owners</div><h3>Succession</h3><div class="price price-word">Quoted</div><p>Who runs the company if you cannot. Buy-sell, operating agreements, the hand-off.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing">See fees</a></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Flat fees, quoted on the call. No hourly billing on planning work.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Past · Present · Future</p><h2>Part of Vault Human.</h2><p class="lede">A tercet is three lines that belong together. So is a plan: your will, your trust, and the directive that says what you want. Tercet Law is the law firm in the Vault Human family. It is a law firm, not coaching.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Modernizes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>Executive, leadership and team coaching for companies. Not a law firm.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy me" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com"><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet Law</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, probate and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Tercet Law do?</summary><p>Estate planning and elder law: wills, trusts, health directives, powers of attorney, probate and business succession. Flat fees.</p></details><details><summary>Is the call confidential?</summary><p>Yes. Attorney-client confidentiality applies from the first conversation.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a trust?</summary><p>Sometimes. The call tells you honestly, and the price is the same either way.</p></details><details><summary>Where are you licensed?</summary><p>Alabama, with Texas admission pending. Based in Austin. Virtual appointments.</p></details><details><summary>How long does it take?</summary><p>Most plans are signed within three to four weeks of the first call.</p></details><details><summary>What is Vault Human?</summary><p>Daily coaching, run by the same owner. It is separate from your legal work and never required.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524758631624-e2822e304c36?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A bright, quiet office" loading="lazy" /><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Book a confidential planning call.</h2><p class="lede">Thirty minutes. You leave knowing what you need and exactly what it costs.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

